{"steam_appid":2402680,"steam_name":"Dimraeth","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2402680/390354842/74f17d8c00086220a2e071b6b68ea9d98c2aa2ab/1788360601/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788361642","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257415792/c68466f2a4f22a68181f4fab19d90e282ae725b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788361642","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/dd174ea2b12bc9ae903bd989cf2cd31448feb2c5/ss_dd174ea2b12bc9ae903bd989cf2cd31448feb2c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789584092","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/2fb326574314f2f2e160b9df15c411065bdf8044/ss_2fb326574314f2f2e160b9df15c411065bdf8044.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789584092","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/a01d7c21438c3e60a47eea59405b128af2333566/ss_a01d7c21438c3e60a47eea59405b128af2333566.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789584092","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/a12742dfef0aedbfcb462a549245b1789dd6555f/ss_a12742dfef0aedbfcb462a549245b1789dd6555f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789584092","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/be6466db1ec3df5bdad949b03b16e8de7c40e792/ss_be6466db1ec3df5bdad949b03b16e8de7c40e792.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789584092"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimraeth is a hybrid action RPG blending deliberate Souls-lite combat and deep character progression with crafting and base-building. Explore a handcrafted pixel-art fantasy world alone or with up to seven other players in seamless drop-in/drop-out co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shadow Over Mirkea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corruption spreads across Mirkea. Sylbos, Last of the Ogre Magi, seeks to claim Dimraeth and the power upon which it stands. By a twist of fate, you are granted an ancient power you do not understand. The venerable wizard Faustas recruits you to stand with Mirkea’s free peoples against Sylbos and the dark gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/7aa9581449a1a3d092251c1ef35f0be5.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/7aa9581449a1a3d092251c1ef35f0be5.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/bd707ca3e55355f278f4a12c2b874603.poster.avif?t=1789584092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/bd707ca3e55355f278f4a12c2b874603.webm?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/bd707ca3e55355f278f4a12c2b874603.mp4?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Archetype</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine any of eight races with any of six classes to create 48 distinct Archetypes. Each pairing has its own skill tree and playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/1a810031f38c236f968cd4123c8c8d60.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/1a810031f38c236f968cd4123c8c8d60.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/183d298a6169231f89fbacc01022ab17.poster.avif?t=1789584092\" width=840 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/183d298a6169231f89fbacc01022ab17.webm?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/183d298a6169231f89fbacc01022ab17.mp4?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Attack Is a Commitment,</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina, read enemy telegraphs, and position yourself before choosing to strike, dodge, block, or parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip five spells at a time and build tactical rotations and combinations around your loadout. Your race and class offer their own spells, while crafted spellbooks grant access to universal magic, provided you meet each spell’s attribute requirements. More than 300 spells are available in total. Test your build against demanding enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/733be1ddd0f2e4effcf5df14a21630b1.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/733be1ddd0f2e4effcf5df14a21630b1.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/90c9d780aab9710f02060047879d7cc1.poster.avif?t=1789584092\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/90c9d780aab9710f02060047879d7cc1.webm?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/90c9d780aab9710f02060047879d7cc1.mp4?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure, Then Return Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Mirkea, completing quests and recruiting allies as you fight, claim loot, and gather resources. Return home to craft equipment, brew potions, and cook hearty meals that increase your vitality. Build farms, quarries, and other structures for a steady supply of crops and raw materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper relationships unlock new conversations, personal quests, and potential romances. Invest materials in your allies’ facilities to expand shop inventories, add new crafting services, and open more farming plots. Every journey leaves your hero stronger and your home more complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/16188038bc0f1f7dad6e1435dc1a03c2.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/16188038bc0f1f7dad6e1435dc1a03c2.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/105cd9d86f3e48378b49dd8218eef603.poster.avif?t=1789584092\" width=840 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/105cd9d86f3e48378b49dd8218eef603.webm?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/105cd9d86f3e48378b49dd8218eef603.mp4?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together or Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in seamless drop-in/drop-out co-op for up to eight players. Your hero’s level, equipment, inventory, spells, and personal progression travel between worlds, while story progress, recruited allies, and buildings remain tied to each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0b67008120eb1de6a9c711aacbae20c9.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/0b67008120eb1de6a9c711aacbae20c9.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.poster.avif?t=1789584092\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.webm?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.mp4?t=1789584092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/c56b351e4fd6e3e8280d877975f09900.webp?t=1789584092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/c56b351e4fd6e3e8280d877975f09900.webp?t=1789584092 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimraeth is in active development toward Early Access Release on September 15th 2026. Wishlist and follow us to get updates, early access to content, and help shape the future of Dimraeth with our community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (4th gen) or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (4GB) / AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs on most modern laptops and desktops. 4 GB VRAM required. Integrated graphics not supported.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (6th gen) or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 560 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed for smooth performance on modern mid-range PCs.</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Early Access"],"developers":["Mudtek"],"publishers":["Mudtek"],"release_date":"15 Sep, 2026"}